{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-x-pro-40w-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Luxe X Pro 40W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"pf0\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eDiscover the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eVaporesso\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e LUXE X PRO 40W Pod System, offering a 1500mAh battery, 40W max output, and compatibility with the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eVaporesso\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e LUXE or LUXE XR Pods.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"pf0\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"pf0\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-xr-replacement-pod\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe X Pods\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eVaporesso\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e LUXE X Pods\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"pf0\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-xr-replacement-pod\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe XR Pods\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eVaporesso\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e LUXE XR Pods\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"pf0\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso GTX Coils\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eVaporesso\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e GTX Coils\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"pf0\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eIt can hold 5mL within the pod with GTX coil support. Adopting a zinc-alloy chassis, the LUXE X Pro is stylish and visually striking but is safeguarded against light falls and drops. Packing a 1500mAh battery within the chassis, the Luxe X Pro can work tirelessly throughout the day, but accepts recharges via the Type-C port 